# plotlines-service local config template (MVP doc §5).
# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in real values — never commit .env itself.
#
# The elevation provider's API key lives here, in the sidecar's environment/config.
# The client never talks to the provider directly (ARCH §11.1) — only the sidecar does.
# Provider is not yet selected; rename this key once it is.
PLOTLINES_ELEVATION_API_KEY=

# Weather (Open-Meteo) needs no key (ARCH §11) — nothing to set here.
# No other secrets exist at MVP (MVP doc §5) — no DB credentials, no session keys,
# no OAuth tokens, because none of those tiers are built for desktop MVP.
